# How git stores, diffs and exports the repository's files (D-346).

# Line endings: every text file is stored and checked out with LF, whatever the machine, so no checkout or editor turns
# a shell script, the PHP or a snapshot into CRLF.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binaries: never converted, never diffed as text. The PNGs include the visual baselines (tests/e2e/__snapshots__/).
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.avif binary
*.ico binary
*.mo binary
*.zip binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary

# GitHub's views: the generated types fold in a pull request's diff (npm run types writes them), and the docs are not
# counted as the project's code.
assets/src/types/** linguist-generated
docs/** linguist-documentation

# Left out of `git archive` and GitHub's "Source code (zip)", so either holds what the release zip holds: these lines
# are .distignore's, one for one, and gate 19 (composer gates) fails if the two lists differ.
