# Merge drivers (D-462, D-463), which `composer hooks` registers: lanes' decisions and translations join by entry, not
# by line, so two lanes that each add some never conflict. A clone without the drivers merges these as git always has.
docs/DECISIONS.md merge=decisions
languages/*.po merge=po
